        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Mark Witzigreuter\n- Projects: The Ready Set\n- Organizations: Cell\n- Places: Fort Wayne, Indiana; New York\n- Concepts: singer-songwriter; grunge; college rock; alternative\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter was born on November 14, 1989.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is professionally known as The Ready Set.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is an American singer-songwriter from Fort Wayne, Indiana.\n- Cell were a band based in New York.\n- Cell were often tagged as grunge because of the time frame of their existence.\n- Cell are arguably described more accurately as college rock or alternative.",
